            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ie7l4FIQBTPGrPZNw"
              ><p>You&apos;re about to discover why <strong>thousands of people</strong> are finally <strong>breaking free from nicotine</strong> - without chemicals, without replacements, and without the usual withdrawal struggles.</p><p></p><p>Every year, millions of people try to quit smoking and vaping. </p><p></p><p>Many fail not because of lack of willpower, but because they&apos;re fighting against their <strong>own body&apos;s patterns</strong>.</p><p></p><p>The truth? <strong>Most quitting methods are doomed to fail </strong>from the start.</p><p></p><p>Here&apos;s why...</p></div
            ><div class="iNoxeUVz2wmHDCQgn" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivgzWtqpP5s5RU2gR"><h3>The Hidden Challenge Nobody Talks About</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="image" class="iFnH76vXyZ8Vulo4P"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/h6qHifIS71lTlKj9/advhands2.jpg?width=1280" width="3430" height="1960" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-image instant-image__main"></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ir9fLwffp1JUe0aKG"
                ><p>What if I told you that nicotine isn&apos;t your biggest enemy when trying to quit?</p><p></p><p>The real challenge is something far more fundamental:</p><p></p><p>The <strong>hand-to-mouth habit</strong> that&apos;s become part of your daily life.</p><p></p><p>Think about it...</p><p></p><p>How many times have you reached for a cigarette or vape without even thinking about it?</p><p></p><p>During a stressful moment at work, while having your morning coffee, after a meal.</p><p></p><p>These <strong>physical patterns run deep</strong>.</p><p></p><p>And they&apos;re exactly what traditional quitting methods ignore.</p></div
              ></div
            ><div class="ia1Xnza1hnxwStOSB" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iczgfZSma3uR1tVtO"><h3>The Breakthrough Discovery That Changes Everything</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iqmgk9c7fVzV8VYcb"
                ><p>It started with a simple observation:</p><p></p><p>People who successfully quit smoking or vaping didn&apos;t just break their nicotine addiction.</p><p></p><p>They found a <strong>healthy replacement for their physical habits</strong>.</p><p></p><p>This revelation led to the development of something revolutionary...</p></div
              ></div
            ><div class="ikoqRMFUDeB4PWpdk" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i91ejY6j3VIHclPJQ"><h3>Introducing Lio: The Natural Way Forward</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="image" class="iPgVWpQYb5b03VKW9"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/W6z3PkJjvTr47uMX/whatsappvideo20241204at71156pm2v2.gif?width=1280" width="1280" height="1280" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-image instant-image__main"></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text immfTT8rutt9jj5K4"
                ><p>Lio is the first <strong>natural diffuser designed specifically to work with your body&apos;s patterns</strong>, not against them.</p><p></p><p>But don&apos;t take our word for it...</p><p></p><p>"I was smoking almost 60 cigarettes per day," shares Pedro, a verified customer. "I tried lots of expensive ways to quit smoking but unfortunately without results. I decided to try Lio and in 2 weeks I&apos;m only using this. Without anxiety crisis."</p></div
              ></div
            ><div class="iqXFtSWNeEYvBeEAM" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iDGsj4FwxHrXF93xB"><h3>The Science Behind Why It Works</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="image" class="iv50t6nDTwI8vZePP"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/0yXaPBzCRy0SPrx8/advhtmhabit.png?width=1280" width="1280" height="720" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-image instant-image__main"></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iDwBfFauefIh6LVvU"
                ><p>Your body craves two things:</p><p></p
                ><ol
                  ><li
                    ><p>The <strong>physical motion of bringing something to your mouth</strong></p></li
                  ><li
                    ><p>The sensory <strong>experience of inhaling</strong></p></li
                  ></ol
                ><p></p><p>Lio provides both - naturally and safely.</p><p></p><p>Think of it like this: When you&apos;re thirsty, water satisfies better than sugary soda.</p><p></p><p>Similarly, Lio satisfies your physical cravings <strong>without the harmful chemicals</strong>.</p></div
              ></div
            ><div class="ixWcOcVQeD8WxMvZZ" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJGNRnsnmd4GLwSaV"><h3>Real People, Real Freedom</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="image" class="iWX8goLWSjhUESGrc"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/o0usc5ph43DdgbWJ/advcollage.png?width=1280" width="1000" height="800" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-image instant-image__main"></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9xWsuwZZJ3B70phS"
                ><p>Koen had been smoking for 35 years when he discovered Lio through a colleague.</p><p></p><p>"Quitting was hell," he admits. "With Lio it goes without saying, I don&apos;t leave my house without it."</p><p></p><p>The numbers speak for themselves:</p
